DATA NOT REDISTRIBUTED
======================

router-for-me/models (https://github.com/router-for-me/models) publishes no LICENSE file. Its
data is NOT included in this repository: the adapter that reads it ships without a snapshot,
and the tests that use one run only when the user supplies it locally
(see "Pruebas" in README.md).

The gateway rosters used during development (cache of a CLIProxyAPI gateway, `omp models`
listings of private gateways) are not included either. The tests that cover those adapters
use small synthetic samples built from public model ids.

